WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.015 --> 00:00:05.345
Well, Detective Hayes...

00:00:07.875 --> 00:00:09.515
Could you tell us your timeline of events

00:00:10.345 --> 00:00:12.365
April 7th 1980

00:00:15.745 --> 00:00:17.195
It was just a case

00:00:20.745 --> 00:00:21.995
Now I know it will be my last

00:00:25.880 --> 00:00:28.600
Two kids supposed to be home by 5:30

00:00:28.600 --> 00:00:29.720
Never Arrived

00:00:29.720 --> 00:00:31.720
We almost had a clean night man

00:00:32.960 --> 00:00:34.300
 

00:00:34.940 --> 00:00:36.540
Anything to tell me about Will?

00:00:36.860 --> 00:00:39.660
He's quite. I don't think he got noticed much

00:00:42.960 --> 00:00:45.820
I'm telling you, they didn't run off

00:00:45.820 --> 00:00:48.000
All you had to do was watch them!

00:00:49.740 --> 00:00:51.120
Mind if we look around?

00:00:51.120 --> 00:00:52.680
How you gonna wear that badge?

00:00:52.800 --> 00:00:54.140
Got a little clip on it

00:00:56.020 --> 00:00:58.240
You look like you haven't slept in a couple of days

00:00:58.520 --> 00:01:01.120
I never stop coming up with theories about that case

00:01:01.740 --> 00:01:04.580
In our job, there is no certainty

00:01:05.580 --> 00:01:07.800
What you don't remember you don't know you don't remember

00:01:07.840 --> 00:01:08.380
What?

00:01:11.540 --> 00:01:14.600
Did you think you could just go on and never once have to look back

00:01:17.080 --> 00:01:19.240
My whole brain is a bunch of missing pieces

00:01:19.640 --> 00:01:21.440
You ever been some place you couldn't leave

00:01:21.820 --> 00:01:23.720
You couldn't stay... Both at the same time

00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:26.440
Things I have seen...

00:01:27.540 --> 00:01:28.540
Things I know...

00:01:29.580 --> 00:01:31.440
Wouldn't do anything but cause harm

00:01:31.660 --> 00:01:33.980
Lots of people around this are dead

00:01:33.980 --> 00:01:34.760
Lot of people gone

00:01:34.760 --> 00:01:36.360
Most people I ever knew are gone

00:01:36.560 --> 00:01:39.140
Whatever you think you did or didn't do,

00:01:39.140 --> 00:01:40.960
You don't deserve to suffer

00:01:47.240 --> 00:01:49.560
This case is all that I can think of

00:01:51.500 --> 00:01:53.620
Now I wanna know the whole story

